,title,link,text,language,family
0,Rwanda-Rundi - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rwanda-Rundi,"Rwanda-Rundi or West Highlands Kivu is a group of Bantu languages, specifically a dialect continuum, spoken in Central Africa. Two dialects, Kirundi and Kinyarwanda, have been standardized as the national languages of Burundi and Rwanda respectively.",Rundi,Niger-Congo
1,Kinyarwanda - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kinyarwanda,"It is a dialect of the Rwanda-Rundi language that is also spoken in Uganda, where the dialect is known as Ikinyakore, Rufumbira, or Urufumbira. Kinyarwanda is universal among the native population of Rwanda and is mutually intelligible with Kirundi, the national language of neighbouring Burundi.",Rundi,Niger-Congo
